{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"9178ca23e0556e37","type":"text","text":"[[Aralia Lumiere.canvas]]\n#PlayerCharacter #Lore","x":-660,"y":-520,"width":250,"height":100},
		{"id":"4b9b4de2542cd21a","x":-660,"y":-320,"width":573,"height":357,"type":"text","text":"first ten pages:\n\nSummary:\n\nThe first ten pages read about how Ravina began to start her nation and how she was aware of untapped potential in the Sleeping Goddess. Ravina talks about how she plans to use the Goddess to create new magic capable of making her the strongest sorceress that has ever lived."},
		{"id":"9e296ea39defa065","x":-680,"y":140,"width":613,"height":340,"type":"text","text":"Page 11-20:\n\nSummary: \n\nRavina talks about why she wants power and a nation. \n\n\"Creating a nation is not where my heart lies. He took my brother from me, him and his kind the disgusting immortals who cheat death and believe they can do whatever they wish. My hatred is a knife that I will use to kill that which is unkillable, from now until the end of time I will become the death this world needs. First my father then my mother and lastly my brother, I will not stand for this, should the plot of the Unhileg come forward or the cancer within Barovia try and breach its containment I will do what I must.\""},
		{"id":"c4adce0c8db08588","x":-760,"y":540,"width":774,"height":450,"type":"text","text":"Pages 21 - 100:\n\nSummary:\n\nTalks about how she never knew being a mother could be so fulfilling but also terrifying and that now she is more motivated than ever to stop the evil that plagues this world. She there are also multiple drawings of a purple object with handles on each side.\n\n\n\"I have found the a stone left behind by the Sleeping Goddess, given to her one and only chosen and I will use it to make what I need, I will use it to steal a part of her. With this stone I can open a way through the gate and bargain with the most powerful being in existence I just hope she is able to see the light behind my cause.\"\n\n\"I am sorry Maelle your mother loves you but I must go for the sake of this world\""},
		{"id":"fd423f1b43aaf84d","x":-833,"y":1060,"width":920,"height":360,"type":"text","text":"Page 100-200:\n\nSummary:\n\nTalks about the creation of The Dreamers Heart and how it will become her ultimate tool to achieve what she has always wanted to become what the immortals fear most, Death herself. \n\n\"By the enlightening ritual the Lumiere I will Ascend to a new seat amongst their ranks and then as the one beyond the shackles of the Divine Gate I will twist the threads of fate into the favor of purity. I will steal his foul name and use it against him I will become the shadow he sees at night a will become the fear they have in the hearts and I will become a mother how protects her loved ones until time stops passing. My grief will change this world forever for tomorrow morning I will become the reason people grieve I will become Death I will be knowns as a matron and The Queen of Ravens, The Matron of Ravens, The Raven Queen.\""},
		{"id":"068e52783621120e","x":-822,"y":1600,"width":898,"height":520,"type":"text","text":"page 201-400:\n\nThe Author changes to Maelle:\n\n\"Mother I never knew the sadness in your heart you did not have to leave me, maybe I could have helped you heal, whatever this artifact you left behind is it is changing my I can feel my attachment to magic no longer being that but more of a directly line to the sleeping Goddess herself. At least I know you are always watching over me, I will carry on and live a simple life but my name will be a representation of the light you once gave this world before cloaking in the shadows of your grief. You and the rest of our family will be know as light will honor you and the people will know us as Lumiere.\"\n\nIt goes on to talk about how the nation began to get sent into chaos and the Unileg's leader the Whispered Once signed a deal with Asmodeus to talk what he desires and how Maelle wants to stop them.\n\n\"Vax and I are married now mom and I am going to have a child, I wonder if this is the joy you wrote about earlier in this book. Vax tells me you often speak to him and that you have chosen him as your first protector of our world, dont you worry if he falls I'll be right there to lift him back up. I also found your brothers body burred beneath the castle we lived on I wonder why did you put him there in that coffin, either way I was told by Vax to leave it alone so I did.\""},
		{"id":"be08e27d99f6d8bd","x":-729,"y":2340,"width":712,"height":260,"type":"text","text":"Pages 400 - 800:\n\nTalks about how the nation is falling and Asmodeus is coming for her and that Vax is doing everything he can to combat Barovia the Hells and the Unhileg all at once but it is not enough.\n\n\"Our once great nation has fallen, Vax and I are on the run with nowhere to go so in this book I will leave behind his greatest power, the power he used to move at increadible speed. Whoever the next wearer of The Death Walkers is use it for the good of the people and do not go against its very nature, do not defy death.\""}
	],
